WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.110
Plants can't run, bite or chase.

2
00:00:03.160 --> 00:00:06.430
They spend their whole
lives rooted to one spot.

3
00:00:06.480 --> 00:00:08.330
Yet in a crowded wood,

4
00:00:08.380 --> 00:00:11.210
every plant is locked in a
contest with its neighbours,

5
00:00:11.260 --> 00:00:13.550
every single day.

6
00:00:13.600 --> 00:00:16.530
Oaks, bluebells and
brambles are all in it.

7
00:00:16.580 --> 00:00:19.470
So what could plants
possibly be fighting over?

8
00:00:19.520 --> 00:00:22.890
In this mission, you'll find
out what plants compete for,

9
00:00:22.940 --> 00:00:24.800
and what animals compete for.

10
00:00:24.850 --> 00:00:28.310
You'll sort the things that
affect living things into abiotic

11
00:00:28.360 --> 00:00:31.950
factors, the non-living
ones, and biotic factors,

12
00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:33.230
the living ones.

13
00:00:33.280 --> 00:00:36.290
And you'll see how the species
in a community depend on each

14
00:00:36.340 --> 00:00:38.630
other: interdependence.

15
00:00:38.680 --> 00:00:42.150
Your mission: find out what
plants in a crowded wood are

16
00:00:42.200 --> 00:00:43.450
fighting over.
